  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110020,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "プロデューサー、何かあったんですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_angry",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おはよう、灯織！\r\n前に出たリポート番組あっただろう",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110030,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい\r\nあ、もしかして……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、またオファーが来たんだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110040,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "本当ですか……！\r\nまた、あの番組に……",
    "charAnim1": "smile1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "しかも、それだけじゃない",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "灯織が行ってみたいって言ってた場所が\r\nロケ地なんだそうだ！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110050,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そうなんですか……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "すごい偶然だよな",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110060,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そっか……\r\n伝えられるんだ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110070,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私が、好きな景色を……\r\n私の言葉で……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ！　このまま行けばもっと……\r\nそれこそ、灯織が一番見たい景色だって、見られるかもな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110080,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "一番、見たい……",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110090,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500,
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110090"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1500
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……？\r\nどうした？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110100,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "私が……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110110,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "これから先、私が一番見たい景色を\r\n見られるかもしれないのは、確かに嬉しいです",
    "charAnim1": "sad3",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110120,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、それと同じくらい素敵な景色を……\r\n私は、もう見たことがあります",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだったのか\r\nいつの間に──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110130,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふ、わかりませんか？\r\nその景色は、プロデューサーも見たことがありますよ",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺も……？\r\nそんな景色覚えてないはずがないんだけどな……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "写真を見せてもらった時か……\r\nそれとも、ロケの時に一緒に見た景色……じゃないよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110140,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "ふふっ、あの時の景色、覚えていてくれてたんですね",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110140"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろんだよ\r\n……あれは、違うのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110150,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それも、正解のひとつです",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110160,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "でも、私が知っている、一番綺麗な景色は──",
    "charAnim4": "eye_left",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "off",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110170,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "アイドルを目指してから見てきた景色の全てです",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "000",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうか",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110180,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "はい……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110190,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "『W.I.N.G.』を目指す間に見た\r\nいくつもの景色……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110200,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "それは、ひとつひとつが私の中で輝く\r\n星のような思い出……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110210,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "その中にはいつも真乃がいて……\r\nめぐるがいて……",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110220,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "そして、一番側には……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "hiori",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200200511/2002005110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2002005110230,
    "speaker": "灯織",
    "text": "輝きたいという私の夢を……一番近くで支えてくれた人が……",
